    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n17278" root="ريغ" body-key="r">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَرَاغٌ</span></b> , signifying The <i>place in which beasts roll,</i>
or <i>turn themselves over,</i> is thought by Az to be so
called from <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رِيَاغٌ</span> in the first of the senses assigned
to it above. (TA.)

